* British 900 SL power amp, transcribed from the factory schematic (drawing 2100-60-34, EL34 version): long-tailed
* ECC83 phase inverter with the negative feedback into the second grid, four EL34 as two parallel pairs, the output
* transformer as five coupled windings and the HT supply solved together with the audio. The presence control is VR8 with R29 and C6 (they are drawn on the preamp board).

S VAUDIO pin 50k 0
S VHT a 1 490
S VBIAS nb 22k -95

* Phase inverter V4: input on the first grid (C7), feedback on the second (C8); both grids are returned through R20 and R21.
C C7 pin ga 0.022u
R R20 ga f1 1M
R R21 f1 gb 1M
R R19 kc f1 1k
R R18 f1 f2 15k
C C8 gb f2 0.1u
R R6 f2 0 4.7k
* Presence: C6 (100n) and R29 (1k) in series with the presence rheostat VR8 (22k) from the feedback node to ground (preamp board, drawing SLXa-61-02).
C C6 f2 pq 0.1u
R R29 pq pr 1k
R VR8 pr 0 1
T V4A ga pa kc 12AX7
T V4B gb pb kc 12AX7
R R22 x pa 82k
R R23 x pb 91k
C C14 x pa 100p
C C15 pa pb 100p
C C9 pa dt 0.047u
C C10 pb db 0.047u

* Power-tube grid return (R27 / R26) and the fixed bias (-48 V at the trimmer).
R R27 dt bias 150k
R R26 db bias 150k
C C11 bias 0 10u
R R28 nb bias 47k
R VR2 bias 0 70k
C C16 nb 0 10u

* EL34s: each pair shares grid stoppers (R24 / R25 and 1k5 per tube), screen resistors and plate load.
R R24 dt g45 2.25k
R R25 db g67 2.25k
P V6 g45 pt s45 0 EL34 2
P V7 g67 pbm s67 0 EL34 2
R R31_32 sb s45 1k/2
R R33_34 sb s67 1k/2

* Output transformer (C3070): plate-to-plate 1.9k, 3.5 H per primary half; windings are
* primary halves, then the 16R, 8R and 4R sections of the secondary (turns relative to a half).
R DCR_PT pt npt 40
R DCR_PBM pbm npb 40
.param n16 = 2*1/sqrt(1900/16)
.xfmr OT L=3.5 SAT=4.7
  W npt a 1 pri
  W a npb 1 pri
  W t16 t8 0.2929*n16 sec
  W t8 bk 0.2071*n16 sec
  W bk 0 0.5*n16 sec
  K pri pri 0.9998
  K pri sec 0.9993
  K sec sec 0.9998
.end
R RLOAD t16 0 16

* Negative feedback from the secondary to the phase inverter's feedback node (R17 and C13).
R R17 bk f2 27k
C C13 bk f2 220p

* HT supply: R35, the reservoir capacitors, R30 and the preamp rail.
R R35 a sb 100
C C12 sb 0 50u
R R30 sb x 22k
C C21X x 0 50u
R RPREAMP x 0 80k
